.TP
.B ResponsiveTable::new(rows: &'a [T])
.TP
.B ResponsiveTable::row_height_of(density: Density)
The row height a density gives: 48 px by default, 32 compact.
.TP
.B ResponsiveTable::pitch(row_height: f32)
The height of one row in a virtualized table plus its hairline: what to give \fBViewport::window\fR as the pitch.
